      "html": "<div id=\"step-q274625\" class=\"step questionWidget\" stepid=\"q274625\" questionid=\"274625\" format=\"MC\" answer=\"\" current=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 1</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Given the matrices\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mrow space=\"4\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 4.278em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-right: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-right: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-right: 0.5em; padding-top: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-right: 0.5em; padding-top: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-top: 0.2em;\"><mjx-